<title>HUNGARY: INDICATORS - HUNGARY - UPDATED OCT 16.</title>
<headline>INDICATORS - HUNGARY - UPDATED OCT 16.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The latest indicators:</p>
<p> CPI (pct)		Aug +0.3m/m +22.9yr/yr  (July +0.4 +23.0)</p>
<p> PPI (pct)		Aug +1.7m/m +20.9yr/yr  (July +0.5 +20.4)</p>
<p>Industry output(pct) Aug -9.1m/m  -3.2yr/yr  (July +11.7 +8.3)</p>
<p> Current account	Jan-July -$967 mln   (Jan-June -$934 mln)</p>
<p> NBH trade balance    Jan-July -$1.438 bln(Jan-June -$1.194bln)</p>
<p> MIT trade balance    Jan-Aug -$2.012 bln (Jan-July -$1.744bln)</p>
