<p> Unemployment (pct)   Sept 11.0 pct		  (Aug 10.8 pct)</p>
<p>Budget deficit (HUF) Jan-Sept 114.8 bln (Jan-Aug HUF 120.6bln)</p>
<p>T-bill yields% (1mo) 22.22 (3mo) 22.50 (6mo) 22.62 (1yr) 22.72</p>
